# UNIT CELL
LatticeConstant       1.0 Ang 
%block LatticeVectors
       19.9792633057         0.0000000000         0.0000000000
        0.0000000000         8.6512748850         0.0000000000
        0.0000000000         0.0000000000         7.0637359619
